(4000035, 571364, 56167, '<td valign="top">what a lovely photo great detail, but I feel sorry for it with the flies on its nose, poor beast, but I cannot feel that it fits the challenge as there is no landscape, sorry</td>', 'what a lovely photo great detail, but I feel sorry for it with the flies on its nose, poor beast, but I cannot feel that it fits the challenge as there is no landscape, sorry', '2007-08-15 09:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
