(4000044, 570941, 56167, '<td valign="top">beautiful, lovely shades, good focus, lighting and the best I have saw so far. well done ~10</td>', 'beautiful, lovely shades, good focus, lighting and the best I have saw so far. well done ~10', '2007-08-15 09:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000045, 569996, 53668, '<td valign="top">well............I love it.</td>', 'well............I love it.', '2007-08-15 09:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000067, 568741, 51269, '<td valign="top">really not a landscape but nice macro .</td>', 'really not a landscape but nice macro .', '2007-08-15 09:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000070, 571843, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE - is she the Queen of the Mountain?  Nice comp;osition.</td>', 'HEE HEE - is she the Queen of the Mountain?  Nice comp;osition.', '2007-08-15 09:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000075, 571674, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed with balance. I''d love to see a sole cow or horse out in the field. ;~D</td>', 'Nicely composed with balance. I''d love to see a sole cow or horse out in the field. ;~D', '2007-08-15 09:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000079, 571755, 15711, '<td valign="top">On my monitor, although the colors are vivid and pretty they don''t look real to me. A touch too saturated. If it had been mine, I''d have cropped in panorama style, so that there is less sky, and we are concentrating more on the land, but that''s just me. ;~D</td>', 'On my monitor, although the colors are vivid and pretty they don''t look real to me. A touch too saturated. If it had been mine, I''d have cropped in panorama style, so that there is less sky, and we are concentrating more on the land, but that''s just me. ;~D', '2007-08-15 09:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000080, 571908, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  It isn''t the typical landscape. The screening makes for interesting texture.</td>', 'I really like this.  It isn''t the typical landscape. The screening makes for interesting texture.', '2007-08-15 09:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000083, 571970, 25520, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t for the haze, I would rate higher.</td>', 'If it weren''t for the haze, I would rate higher.', '2007-08-15 09:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000085, 571939, 51269, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image - looks like where I live !</td>', 'Beautiful image - looks like where I live !', '2007-08-15 09:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000089, 571114, 25520, '<td valign="top">Perfect moment for this photo.</td>', 'Perfect moment for this photo.', '2007-08-15 09:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000092, 571862, 51269, '<td valign="top">A nice composition but seems slightly blurry...</td>', 'A nice composition but seems slightly blurry...', '2007-08-15 09:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000096, 569248, 25520, '<td valign="top">Only the forground grass seems sharp.</td>', 'Only the forground grass seems sharp.', '2007-08-15 09:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000097, 571042, 25520, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. I don''t think the house adds anything to the composition.</td>', 'Beautiful colors. I don''t think the house adds anything to the composition.', '2007-08-15 09:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000101, 571999, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really nice.  Perfect title too.  The bleached out sepia suits this perfectly.  I wish there a touch more detail in the old ramshackled building but given the lighting and time of day, it suits it.  One of the better images of this challenge in my opinion. 7</td>', 'Really nice.  Perfect title too.  The bleached out sepia suits this perfectly.  I wish there a touch more detail in the old ramshackled building but given the lighting and time of day, it suits it.  One of the better images of this challenge in my opinion. 7', '2007-08-15 09:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000102, 571384, 25520, '<td valign="top">too washed out.</td>', 'too washed out.', '2007-08-15 09:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000104, 571117, 15711, '<td valign="top">That old beat up car really adds a punch of color.  This is lovely and the sky is outstanding.  Different and not expected. 7</td>', 'That old beat up car really adds a punch of color.  This is lovely and the sky is outstanding.  Different and not expected. 7', '2007-08-15 09:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000105, 568197, 25520, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, might have been better with more contrast.</td>', 'Nice composition, might have been better with more contrast.', '2007-08-15 09:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000108, 571292, 15711, '<td valign="top">GREAT title.  The seagull makes the shot for me and helps give it balance.</td>', 'GREAT title.  The seagull makes the shot for me and helps give it balance.', '2007-08-15 09:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000109, 569188, 25520, '<td valign="top">Glad I''m not in Wyoming. Could you have used a UV filter?</td>', 'Glad I''m not in Wyoming. Could you have used a UV filter?', '2007-08-15 09:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000112, 571114, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the overall tones of this.  The sky is beautiful.  I wish it were panned back a bit. I had the same problem and couldn''t get that vista feel either (so I didn''t enter - LOL)</td>', 'I like the overall tones of this.  The sky is beautiful.  I wish it were panned back a bit. I had the same problem and couldn''t get that vista feel either (so I didn''t enter - LOL)', '2007-08-15 09:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000114, 569879, 25520, '<td valign="top">Makes my head swim a little, but very nice overall.</td>', 'Makes my head swim a little, but very nice overall.', '2007-08-15 09:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000115, 571777, 61961, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I''m not alone in mentioning this, but I think you entered this in the wrong challenge. Even if this is a "rural" alley, the Yankees cap implies otherwise.  :-/</td>', 'I''m sure I''m not alone in mentioning this, but I think you entered this in the wrong challenge. Even if this is a "rural" alley, the Yankees cap implies otherwise.  :-/', '2007-08-15 10:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000116, 570789, 25520, '<td valign="top">Looks like the center of activity in this area.</td>', 'Looks like the center of activity in this area.', '2007-08-15 10:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000120, 570393, 25520, '<td valign="top">Nice rich colors.</td>', 'Nice rich colors.', '2007-08-15 10:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000123, 571142, 49109, '<td valign="top">fine shot, great colors, amazing sharpness</td>', 'fine shot, great colors, amazing sharpness', '2007-08-15 10:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000124, 570328, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is stunning.  I love that we can see hay bales (?) through the foggy blur.  Nice diagonal line.  This is well composed.</td>', 'This is stunning.  I love that we can see hay bales (?) through the foggy blur.  Nice diagonal line.  This is well composed.', '2007-08-15 10:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000127, 569248, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I''m a huge fan of the silhouetted cows. I wish the trees were a touch darker as well. I love the golden tones.</td>', 'Very nice. I''m a huge fan of the silhouetted cows. I wish the trees were a touch darker as well. I love the golden tones.', '2007-08-15 10:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000129, 571397, 15711, '<td valign="top">The flick of the tail makes the shot.  Perfectly exposed and the  focus is great.  Nice balance and composition. One of the better ones.</td>', 'The flick of the tail makes the shot.  Perfectly exposed and the  focus is great.  Nice balance and composition. One of the better ones.', '2007-08-15 10:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000130, 569391, 25520, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to be there now.</td>', 'Makes me want to be there now.', '2007-08-15 10:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000132, 571952, 25520, '<td valign="top">Very vivid</td>', 'Very vivid', '2007-08-15 10:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000137, 570558, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones.  I like the lines of the shore curving to create bottom and upper shot lines.  The girl grounds the shot and adds interest. I don''t necessarily think of a rocky shore as rural, but no points off because of my opinion. It''s a gorgeous image.</td>', 'Beautiful tones.  I like the lines of the shore curving to create bottom and upper shot lines.  The girl grounds the shot and adds interest. I don''t necessarily think of a rocky shore as rural, but no points off because of my opinion. It''s a gorgeous image.', '2007-08-15 10:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000141, 571757, 15711, '<td valign="top">A touch over saturated for my taste but the vista is lovely.</td>', 'A touch over saturated for my taste but the vista is lovely.', '2007-08-15 10:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000143, 569879, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very cool fisheye effect but the sky is a touch over saturated for my taste.</td>', 'Very cool fisheye effect but the sky is a touch over saturated for my taste.', '2007-08-15 10:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000146, 570825, 25520, '<td valign="top">Very nice landscape, and the clouds were coorporating with you.</td>', 'Very nice landscape, and the clouds were coorporating with you.', '2007-08-15 10:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000148, 571846, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the story.  Nice tones.  Very nostalgic and the gun adds a nice line and definitely a punch to the mood of it.</td>', 'I like the story.  Nice tones.  Very nostalgic and the gun adds a nice line and definitely a punch to the mood of it.', '2007-08-15 10:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000149, 570453, 25520, '<td valign="top">I could see this hanging on a wall. Very nice scene.</td>', 'I could see this hanging on a wall. Very nice scene.', '2007-08-15 10:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000151, 569996, 25520, '<td valign="top">I don''t see much landscape.</td>', 'I don''t see much landscape.', '2007-08-15 10:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000153, 570802, 25520, '<td valign="top">Nice village.</td>', 'Nice village.', '2007-08-15 10:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000155, 571678, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is lovely.  The layers of trees blending into the background are gorgeous.  I love the crisp silhouettes of the deer antlers. If it were mine, I might''ve cropped it a bit off of the bottom but no points off.</td>', 'This is lovely.  The layers of trees blending into the background are gorgeous.  I love the crisp silhouettes of the deer antlers. If it were mine, I might''ve cropped it a bit off of the bottom but no points off.', '2007-08-15 10:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000156, 571825, 25520, '<td valign="top">Very calm, relaxing scene.</td>', 'Very calm, relaxing scene.', '2007-08-15 10:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000160, 571668, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  I might have adjusted curves a smidge to deepen the overall tones. The yellow flowers are a lovely subject with the vista view as the backdrop. 7</td>', 'I really like this.  I might have adjusted curves a smidge to deepen the overall tones. The yellow flowers are a lovely subject with the vista view as the backdrop. 7', '2007-08-15 10:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000166, 570941, 25520, '<td valign="top">Very intense.</td>', 'Very intense.', '2007-08-15 10:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000168, 570026, 25520, '<td valign="top">This isn''t really my idea of landscape, but I like it just the same.</td>', 'This isn''t really my idea of landscape, but I like it just the same.', '2007-08-15 10:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000169, 568278, 25520, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful. Where is this?</td>', 'Very beautiful. Where is this?', '2007-08-15 10:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000175, 571477, 25520, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice. Probably my only 10 to give out.</td>', 'Very, very nice. Probably my only 10 to give out.', '2007-08-15 10:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000176, 570155, 25520, '<td valign="top">Somewhat stark, but nice.</td>', 'Somewhat stark, but nice.', '2007-08-15 10:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000180, 570883, 25520, '<td valign="top">Very still.</td>', 'Very still.', '2007-08-15 10:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
