(4002952, 570978, 70181, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I would have like a little more depth of field to get rid of the blurred foreground, but that''s a minor complaint.  Great composition and the photo make me wish I was there.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I would have like a little more depth of field to get rid of the blurred foreground, but that''s a minor complaint.  Great composition and the photo make me wish I was there.', '2007-08-16 00:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
