(4003355, 571860, 49109, '<td valign="top">the yellow border is awful.<br/>since you asked: I had preferred to see more of the landscape and less of the tree and moss. it also seems, that the horizon is tilted to the left. whole image could be sharper, too</td>', 'the yellow border is awful.since you asked: I had preferred to see more of the landscape and less of the tree and moss. it also seems, that the horizon is tilted to the left. whole image could be sharper, too', '2007-08-16 04:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
