(4003491, 568947, 34938, '<td valign="top">ok...want to be kind and constructive...it just looks like an image that was taken by pulling the car over on a country road and taking a snapshot. There is not a lot of thought here and there''s nothing that really pops out in the image. The power lines really spoil it and none of the animales are facing the right way...sorry :-(</td>', 'ok...want to be kind and constructive...it just looks like an image that was taken by pulling the car over on a country road and taking a snapshot. There is not a lot of thought here and there''s nothing that really pops out in the image. The power lines really spoil it and none of the animales are facing the right way...sorry :-(', '2007-08-16 07:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003494, 571397, 34938, '<td valign="top">great perspective and a dramatic point of view...lovely crisp image</td>', 'great perspective and a dramatic point of view...lovely crisp image', '2007-08-16 07:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
