(4003499, 569188, 34938, '<td valign="top">the focus is quite soft and the composition lacks creativity...perhaps if you were closer to the hay and did something interesting with the composition??? Having a central horizon is not great, especially with a washed out sky...don''t want to be critical, just helpful for the future... :(</td>', 'the focus is quite soft and the composition lacks creativity...perhaps if you were closer to the hay and did something interesting with the composition??? Having a central horizon is not great, especially with a washed out sky...don''t want to be critical, just helpful for the future... :(', '2007-08-16 07:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
