(4003504, 571362, 34938, '<td valign="top">want to help you for the future, so don''t take this as a harsh criticism...It''s just really bland. the sky is washed out, the composition is not good and there is no real WOW in this at all. It''s just a snapshot rather than a well thought out image. The seat is even cropped. You also saved this as a 480 pixel image and not 640 pixels so it is really hard to judge properly. I would revisit this and start all over again looking for some interesting feature and photographing that...sorry :(</td>', 'want to help you for the future, so don''t take this as a harsh criticism...It''s just really bland. the sky is washed out, the composition is not good and there is no real WOW in this at all. It''s just a snapshot rather than a well thought out image. The seat is even cropped. You also saved this as a 480 pixel image and not 640 pixels so it is really hard to judge properly. I would revisit this and start all over again looking for some interesting feature and photographing that...sorry :(', '2007-08-16 07:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
