(4003702, 569859, 67258, '<td valign="top">Perfect for the challenge. I love the composition, the way you have used the light, and that wonderful sky.  I am less convinced by the post processing - in particular, the photo is way over-sharpened for my taste.</td>', 'Perfect for the challenge. I love the composition, the way you have used the light, and that wonderful sky.  I am less convinced by the post processing - in particular, the photo is way over-sharpened for my taste.', '2007-08-16 09:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
