(4003727, 571983, 67258, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t meet meet the challeng e title/description - I wonder if, perhaps, you intended to enter in the Speed Free Study?  It must have been wonderful to see a falcon (?) like this, in the wild, and so close.  You have captured good detail.</td>', 'This doesn''t meet meet the challeng e title/description - I wonder if, perhaps, you intended to enter in the Speed Free Study?  It must have been wonderful to see a falcon (?) like this, in the wild, and so close.  You have captured good detail.', '2007-08-16 09:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
