(4005665, 572003, 47096, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the scene, but I think this would have been a much stronger photo in black and white or color. The choice of hues here is somewhat  disturbing and distracting. 6.</td>', 'I like the composition and the scene, but I think this would have been a much stronger photo in black and white or color. The choice of hues here is somewhat  disturbing and distracting. 6.', '2007-08-16 23:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
