(4005909, 571771, 76676, '<td valign="top">Im missing the part about landscapes.....</td>', 'Im missing the part about landscapes.....', '2007-08-17 02:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005972, 571315, 76430, '<td valign="top">It needs to be brightened up and the straw-chopper got chopped off of the combine.  Other than not being a John Deere this is almost like one I used to drive on my dad''s farm while in high school.</td>', 'It needs to be brightened up and the straw-chopper got chopped off of the combine.  Other than not being a John Deere this is almost like one I used to drive on my dad''s farm while in high school.', '2007-08-17 02:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005975, 570991, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mirror lake and good red coloring in the canoes.</td>', 'Beautiful mirror lake and good red coloring in the canoes.', '2007-08-17 02:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005978, 568253, 76430, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been improved in landscape mode</td>', 'I think this would have been improved in landscape mode', '2007-08-17 02:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005985, 571136, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice thirds, coloring and sharpness</td>', 'Nice thirds, coloring and sharpness', '2007-08-17 02:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005986, 570322, 76430, '<td valign="top">Too long an exposure with the star trails, and not much interesting, just the three silos and a couple of lights.</td>', 'Too long an exposure with the star trails, and not much interesting, just the three silos and a couple of lights.', '2007-08-17 02:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005993, 569879, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice super wide angle shot.  It may be a little too sharpened with the fake looking clouds and sky.  You really got a lot of barrell distortion.  Is this a fisheye lens?</td>', 'Nice super wide angle shot.  It may be a little too sharpened with the fake looking clouds and sky.  You really got a lot of barrell distortion.  Is this a fisheye lens?', '2007-08-17 02:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005996, 570887, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice haze effect in the trees.  The radio station and Coke stuff in the background really conflicts with the rest of the pastoral scene imho.</td>', 'Nice haze effect in the trees.  The radio station and Coke stuff in the background really conflicts with the rest of the pastoral scene imho.', '2007-08-17 02:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006002, 570453, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful golden glow from sunrise/sunset.  Nicely composed other than the horizon appears to be off some</td>', 'Beautiful golden glow from sunrise/sunset.  Nicely composed other than the horizon appears to be off some', '2007-08-17 02:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006004, 571148, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice thirds.  I see you made full use of the allowable size making it about 640 square.  Nice sharp picture.</td>', 'Nice thirds.  I see you made full use of the allowable size making it about 640 square.  Nice sharp picture.', '2007-08-17 02:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006005, 568167, 76430, '<td valign="top">It''s a very good concept, but the picture seems to be sort of dull colored overall.  Maybe some more PP saturation would have helped it.</td>', 'It''s a very good concept, but the picture seems to be sort of dull colored overall.  Maybe some more PP saturation would have helped it.', '2007-08-17 02:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006010, 568390, 76430, '<td valign="top">Most of it is grainy road.  If the bottom half was chopped off I think it would be much nicer.  And use some Noise Ninja or Neat Image or better yet, lower ISO and a tripod.</td>', 'Most of it is grainy road.  If the bottom half was chopped off I think it would be much nicer.  And use some Noise Ninja or Neat Image or better yet, lower ISO and a tripod.', '2007-08-17 03:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006013, 570941, 76430, '<td valign="top">Many of these are lacking saturation.  This one may be overboard in PP saturation, but the other-worldly title fits it.</td>', 'Many of these are lacking saturation.  This one may be overboard in PP saturation, but the other-worldly title fits it.', '2007-08-17 03:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006017, 568684, 76430, '<td valign="top">Too much wide open sky and not enough land.  I''d recommend putting the horizon on one of the thirds lines, maybe the higher one, since there are few interesting clouds.  It also needs more sharpness.</td>', 'Too much wide open sky and not enough land.  I''d recommend putting the horizon on one of the thirds lines, maybe the higher one, since there are few interesting clouds.  It also needs more sharpness.', '2007-08-17 03:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006018, 571364, 76430, '<td valign="top">Is this a landscape?  I haven''t been mentioning DNMC for shots where the landscape isn''t the subject, but this one goes over the line.  The only landscape is a patch of grass.</td>', 'Is this a landscape?  I haven''t been mentioning DNMC for shots where the landscape isn''t the subject, but this one goes over the line.  The only landscape is a patch of grass.', '2007-08-17 03:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006020, 571939, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautifully colored.  This far outshines very similar ones with drab coloring.</td>', 'Beautifully colored.  This far outshines very similar ones with drab coloring.', '2007-08-17 03:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006027, 571771, 76430, '<td valign="top">No landscape, but nice shot.  5</td>', 'No landscape, but nice shot.  5', '2007-08-17 03:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006029, 571375, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice rainbow</td>', 'Nice rainbow', '2007-08-17 03:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006035, 571988, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very long time exposure exposed very well for the varying light conditions with the sunrise/sunset and plants.  You don''t get second chances the same day with this.  Something is strange though, the star trails don''t form a consistent arc.  Maybe it''s the wide angle.</td>', 'Very long time exposure exposed very well for the varying light conditions with the sunrise/sunset and plants.  You don''t get second chances the same day with this.  Something is strange though, the star trails don''t form a consistent arc.  Maybe it''s the wide angle.', '2007-08-17 03:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006037, 570478, 76430, '<td valign="top">Rural Landscape???</td>', 'Rural Landscape???', '2007-08-17 03:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006041, 570758, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice coloring.  I think this would have improved by stooping to put the branch over the house.</td>', 'Nice coloring.  I think this would have improved by stooping to put the branch over the house.', '2007-08-17 03:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006045, 569409, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the sun rays in a pretty woods scene.  The light angle doesn''t match the title though.</td>', 'Nice capture of the sun rays in a pretty woods scene.  The light angle doesn''t match the title though.', '2007-08-17 03:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006046, 571924, 76430, '<td valign="top">Interesting carts and water, but the dirt gets boring.  Maybe getting closer at a lower angle would make it better.</td>', 'Interesting carts and water, but the dirt gets boring.  Maybe getting closer at a lower angle would make it better.', '2007-08-17 03:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006100, 571378, 61921, '<td valign="top">hello amazing photo how did u get that color? i would love to know you could PM me that would be awseom :)</td>', 'hello amazing photo how did u get that color? i would love to know you could PM me that would be awseom :)', '2007-08-17 04:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006107, 570012, 82817, '<td valign="top">There is always a trade off in taking a photograph. Here is the washed out sky for the beautiful greens and fencing.</td>', 'There is always a trade off in taking a photograph. Here is the washed out sky for the beautiful greens and fencing.', '2007-08-17 04:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006108, 571285, 82817, '<td valign="top">Looks like the people is gone. There is a stillness in here and I like the reddish cast to the photo.</td>', 'Looks like the people is gone. There is a stillness in here and I like the reddish cast to the photo.', '2007-08-17 04:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
