(4009617, 571384, 82937, '<td valign="top">I''d love to be there in the afternoon...but it looks like it would be pretty spooky at night!</td>', 'I''d love to be there in the afternoon...but it looks like it would be pretty spooky at night!', '2007-08-18 18:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
