(4010757, 568927, 74015, '<td valign="top">Too bad the horizon is cutting the frame in halves and you placed the sun dead center.  Both make for a static shot of a subject that had lots of potential.</td>', 'Too bad the horizon is cutting the frame in halves and you placed the sun dead center.  Both make for a static shot of a subject that had lots of potential.', '2007-08-19 11:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010760, 570393, 74015, '<td valign="top">nice composition.  the clouds are a bit overexposed though.</td>', 'nice composition.  the clouds are a bit overexposed though.', '2007-08-19 11:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010761, 569486, 74015, '<td valign="top">good composition!</td>', 'good composition!', '2007-08-19 11:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010763, 571047, 74015, '<td valign="top">Your subject is too far away to have any punch in the frame.  the scenery is nice and it has photographic potential. I think you could have done better if you had worked the area a bit more, got closer to the cemetary or waited for more dramatic light.</td>', 'Your subject is too far away to have any punch in the frame.  the scenery is nice and it has photographic potential. I think you could have done better if you had worked the area a bit more, got closer to the cemetary or waited for more dramatic light.', '2007-08-19 11:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010764, 570990, 74015, '<td valign="top">Great colors!</td>', 'Great colors!', '2007-08-19 11:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010766, 571477, 74015, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great colors, composition and I like the border.</td>', 'Wow!  Great colors, composition and I like the border.', '2007-08-19 11:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010768, 569388, 74015, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic landscape and a good job of exposure.</td>', 'Very dramatic landscape and a good job of exposure.', '2007-08-19 11:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010769, 570574, 80311, '<td valign="top">I would of take this betwwen near the tree... the alley look too centered for me</td>', 'I would of take this betwwen near the tree... the alley look too centered for me', '2007-08-19 11:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010773, 571757, 74015, '<td valign="top">A bit over saturated (for me anyway).</td>', 'A bit over saturated (for me anyway).', '2007-08-19 11:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010774, 568390, 80311, '<td valign="top">Seem out of focus or blurry.. a lot of noise... sad because the lines were interesting</td>', 'Seem out of focus or blurry.. a lot of noise... sad because the lines were interesting', '2007-08-19 11:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010776, 572007, 74015, '<td valign="top">Oh wow!  I love this!  My only complaint: the donkey''s head is right in the middle...</td>', 'Oh wow!  I love this!  My only complaint: the donkey''s head is right in the middle...', '2007-08-19 11:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010780, 571830, 80311, '<td valign="top">Basic Editing !?!</td>', 'Basic Editing !?!', '2007-08-19 11:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010783, 571311, 74015, '<td valign="top">Either it is way out of focus or you need to get some tips on how to prepare your shots for the web site so they retain their sharpness.  This looks like it is too low in resolution.  The composition and colors were good though and it would have done way better if it had been sharp.</td>', 'Either it is way out of focus or you need to get some tips on how to prepare your shots for the web site so they retain their sharpness.  This looks like it is too low in resolution.  The composition and colors were good though and it would have done way better if it had been sharp.', '2007-08-19 11:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010784, 570887, 73250, '<td valign="top">Looks like the cows are coming home! Couldn''t resisit...is this Wisconsin?</td>', 'Looks like the cows are coming home! Couldn''t resisit...is this Wisconsin?', '2007-08-19 11:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010787, 571375, 80311, '<td valign="top">I would of crpped the photo near the green forest or bushes.  The foreground doesn''t add anything, it messes the photo.  The upper part is awesome!</td>', 'I would of crpped the photo near the green forest or bushes.  The foreground doesn''t add anything, it messes the photo.  The upper part is awesome!', '2007-08-19 11:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010788, 569261, 74015, '<td valign="top">Can''t say anything more than WOW - this is a job well done!</td>', 'Can''t say anything more than WOW - this is a job well done!', '2007-08-19 11:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010789, 571311, 80311, '<td valign="top">too blurry... there is no details, looks like a picture from a cell phone!</td>', 'too blurry... there is no details, looks like a picture from a cell phone!', '2007-08-19 11:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010790, 571968, 80311, '<td valign="top">Excellent... but I don''t see where it fits in the challenge, there''s not much that say rural.</td>', 'Excellent... but I don''t see where it fits in the challenge, there''s not much that say rural.', '2007-08-19 11:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010791, 571696, 74015, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you caught some sun rays on the lower plants and the nice contrast that make with the shadowy, misty "roadblock" in the back.</td>', 'I really like the way you caught some sun rays on the lower plants and the nice contrast that make with the shadowy, misty "roadblock" in the back.', '2007-08-19 11:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010792, 570451, 80311, '<td valign="top">Like the idea!</td>', 'Like the idea!', '2007-08-19 11:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010796, 571946, 74015, '<td valign="top">it almost look like the sky was painted on...</td>', 'it almost look like the sky was painted on...', '2007-08-19 11:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010804, 571116, 65083, '<td valign="top">what a cool shot it evokes country</td>', 'what a cool shot it evokes country', '2007-08-19 11:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010808, 571288, 65083, '<td valign="top">so true, we forget sometimes that we have so much.</td>', 'so true, we forget sometimes that we have so much.', '2007-08-19 11:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010811, 571136, 65083, '<td valign="top">looks like a postcard to visit the country</td>', 'looks like a postcard to visit the country', '2007-08-19 11:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010815, 570012, 65083, '<td valign="top">makes me think about moving out of the city</td>', 'makes me think about moving out of the city', '2007-08-19 11:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010818, 570575, 65083, '<td valign="top">awesome</td>', 'awesome', '2007-08-19 11:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010819, 571364, 65083, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2007-08-19 11:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010821, 568343, 74015, '<td valign="top">LOVELY!!</td>', 'LOVELY!!', '2007-08-19 11:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010822, 569352, 74015, '<td valign="top">You really should have cloned out the dust specks in the sky.  Alos,not placing the horizon in the middle f the frame would have helped emphasize the poppy in the front.</td>', 'You really should have cloned out the dust specks in the sky.  Alos,not placing the horizon in the middle f the frame would have helped emphasize the poppy in the front.', '2007-08-19 11:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010825, 570870, 74015, '<td valign="top">the shallow depth of field was a good idea to play with the dew drops but you really should have focused clearly on one of the flowers, to anchor the eye of the viewer somewhere.  Right now, it just wanders around, wondering what you really wanted to showcase.  That being said, kudos for trying something really different!</td>', 'the shallow depth of field was a good idea to play with the dew drops but you really should have focused clearly on one of the flowers, to anchor the eye of the viewer somewhere.  Right now, it just wanders around, wondering what you really wanted to showcase.  That being said, kudos for trying something really different!', '2007-08-19 11:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010857, 570883, 73250, '<td valign="top">I really like this a lot...the lighting is excellent and the comp great. To be a true landscape...I would have liked the person not to have been there...they interupt the flow of the image, not enhance it.</td>', 'I really like this a lot...the lighting is excellent and the comp great. To be a true landscape...I would have liked the person not to have been there...they interupt the flow of the image, not enhance it.', '2007-08-19 12:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010861, 568315, 73250, '<td valign="top">very nice color and composition. I love the haze...this is just beautiful...it embodies what I picture when someone says rural landscape. 10</td>', 'very nice color and composition. I love the haze...this is just beautiful...it embodies what I picture when someone says rural landscape. 10', '2007-08-19 12:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010870, 571846, 73250, '<td valign="top">A true landscape tries to avoid having people in the image. However, I really like this alot...it''s such a through back. The comp is dead on and the tones very nicely done. 10</td>', 'A true landscape tries to avoid having people in the image. However, I really like this alot...it''s such a through back. The comp is dead on and the tones very nicely done. 10', '2007-08-19 12:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010874, 568343, 73250, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites of this challenge. It truly says rural to me...it''s what pops into my head when thinking of the country. Very nicely composed and the colors and lighing are beautiful. Well done. 10</td>', 'This is one of my favorites of this challenge. It truly says rural to me...it''s what pops into my head when thinking of the country. Very nicely composed and the colors and lighing are beautiful. Well done. 10', '2007-08-19 12:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010878, 571425, 73250, '<td valign="top">I''m having a childhood flashback...it''s what I see in my head. I remember picking Queen Anne''s Lace and tickling our noses with the fuzzy tail looking things (can''t remember their name). Really nice tones and well composed. 9</td>', 'I''m having a childhood flashback...it''s what I see in my head. I remember picking Queen Anne''s Lace and tickling our noses with the fuzzy tail looking things (can''t remember their name). Really nice tones and well composed. 9', '2007-08-19 12:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010886, 569261, 73250, '<td valign="top">This is a really lovely shot..the lighting is beautiful and the composition excellent. It''s really not a rural landscape...but, I like it. 9</td>', 'This is a really lovely shot..the lighting is beautiful and the composition excellent. It''s really not a rural landscape...but, I like it. 9', '2007-08-19 12:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010908, 572005, 82944, '<td valign="top">This photo pulls you in - makes you feel as if you are there.</td>', 'This photo pulls you in - makes you feel as if you are there.', '2007-08-19 12:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010983, 571678, 66597, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of Alex Saberi''s shot of the elk in the mist. Maybe it is you again, Alex? Anyways, this is absolutely stunning. A 10 all the way.</td>', 'This reminds me of Alex Saberi''s shot of the elk in the mist. Maybe it is you again, Alex? Anyways, this is absolutely stunning. A 10 all the way.', '2007-08-19 13:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010984, 572003, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really love this photo and your processing choices. Very artistic. A big 10.</td>', 'I really love this photo and your processing choices. Very artistic. A big 10.', '2007-08-19 13:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010986, 572005, 66597, '<td valign="top">The DOF and colors are absolutely gorgeous. No haze whatsoever. The clouds really add a sense of depth and perspective. 10.</td>', 'The DOF and colors are absolutely gorgeous. No haze whatsoever. The clouds really add a sense of depth and perspective. 10.', '2007-08-19 13:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010990, 571857, 66597, '<td valign="top">Jeb, is this yours? At any rate, whoever took this, it is sublime. The sunburst from the clouds coming down on the barn is simply gorgeous. The only thing keeping me from giving this a 10 is it looks slightly oversharpened, so 9. Wonderful photo.</td>', 'Jeb, is this yours? At any rate, whoever took this, it is sublime. The sunburst from the clouds coming down on the barn is simply gorgeous. The only thing keeping me from giving this a 10 is it looks slightly oversharpened, so 9. Wonderful photo.', '2007-08-19 13:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010991, 568343, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely gorgeous! What amazing colors in those sun rays!</td>', 'This is absolutely gorgeous! What amazing colors in those sun rays!', '2007-08-19 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010992, 571117, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites in the challenge. The colors are brilliant, the DOF and clouds gorgeous. Very well done.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites in the challenge. The colors are brilliant, the DOF and clouds gorgeous. Very well done.', '2007-08-19 13:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010993, 571114, 66597, '<td valign="top">Absolutely lovely depth with the clouds and grass. One of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Absolutely lovely depth with the clouds and grass. One of the best in the challenge.', '2007-08-19 13:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010997, 569301, 66597, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of horse photos in the challenge, but this one is something special. Those whites are so perfectly exposed, and the fence provides balance and context. Very, very well done.</td>', 'There are a lot of horse photos in the challenge, but this one is something special. Those whites are so perfectly exposed, and the fence provides balance and context. Very, very well done.', '2007-08-19 13:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011021, 572005, 36606, '<td valign="top">this is iceland right. Looks like larus?</td>', 'this is iceland right. Looks like larus?', '2007-08-19 13:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011032, 570883, 51269, '<td valign="top">I hope you ribbon with this...simply beautiful and the lighting is superb ! Ten</td>', 'I hope you ribbon with this...simply beautiful and the lighting is superb ! Ten', '2007-08-19 13:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011038, 571258, 51269, '<td valign="top">I wish it was a little brighter but still very beautiful as is-7</td>', 'I wish it was a little brighter but still very beautiful as is-7', '2007-08-19 13:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011042, 570085, 51269, '<td valign="top">wow -gorgeous ! The cows are a bonus, would stand out even w/o them- ten !</td>', 'wow -gorgeous ! The cows are a bonus, would stand out even w/o them- ten !', '2007-08-19 13:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011045, 570977, 51269, '<td valign="top">I have been seeing a lot of winners  but this is definately at the top of my list ! Ten</td>', 'I have been seeing a lot of winners  but this is definately at the top of my list ! Ten', '2007-08-19 13:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011047, 570104, 51269, '<td valign="top">colors are strange but nice composition (my entry has strange color too !) 7</td>', 'colors are strange but nice composition (my entry has strange color too !) 7', '2007-08-19 13:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011652, 571860, 53878, '<td valign="top">spanish moss is always a good catch...</td>', 'spanish moss is always a good catch...', '2007-08-19 17:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011953, 571697, 51747, '<td valign="top">This looks good but it leaves me wanting to see more. Maybe a different crop?</td>', 'This looks good but it leaves me wanting to see more. Maybe a different crop?', '2007-08-19 20:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012023, 570969, 51747, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture, except for that stray wire in the foreground.</td>', 'Excellent picture, except for that stray wire in the foreground.', '2007-08-19 20:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012034, 571825, 51747, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2007-08-19 20:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012045, 569876, 51747, '<td valign="top">what''s the point?</td>', 'what''s the point?', '2007-08-19 21:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012059, 571042, 35530, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors. The sky is wonderful. Would like to see this at maximum allowed size.</td>', 'Very nice colors. The sky is wonderful. Would like to see this at maximum allowed size.', '2007-08-19 21:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012067, 571380, 37845, '<td valign="top">While I like the overall composition of this shot, I dont like the orange coloured sky, or the off centered border.</td>', 'While I like the overall composition of this shot, I dont like the orange coloured sky, or the off centered border.', '2007-08-19 21:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012071, 569876, 37845, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 1, good luck on your brown.<br/> <br/>Now could you vote mine a 10 in exchange ;)</td>', 'I gave you a 1, good luck on your brown. Now could you vote mine a 10 in exchange ;)', '2007-08-19 21:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012075, 570818, 37845, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, but I would have cropped this a little tighter to avoid the wall on the right side.</td>', 'Cool shot, but I would have cropped this a little tighter to avoid the wall on the right side.', '2007-08-19 21:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012082, 571354, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice zoom blur.</td>', 'Nice zoom blur.', '2007-08-19 21:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012109, 571042, 37845, '<td valign="top">Stunning image, but I wish it was bigger.</td>', 'Stunning image, but I wish it was bigger.', '2007-08-19 21:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012152, 572001, 66038, '<td valign="top">.Wow. I love the way the clouds sort of echo the texture of the wall. Nice photo.</td>', '.Wow. I love the way the clouds sort of echo the texture of the wall. Nice photo.', '2007-08-19 21:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012302, 570273, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice composition between the cow and the house.  The horizon seems slightly tilted to the right.  Maybe it''s just me.</td>', 'Nice composition between the cow and the house.  The horizon seems slightly tilted to the right.  Maybe it''s just me.', '2007-08-19 23:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012313, 570870, 61654, '<td valign="top">I think this is so pretty. Really cool. Well done.</td>', 'I think this is so pretty. Really cool. Well done.', '2007-08-19 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012317, 571378, 61654, '<td valign="top">Maybe slightly oversharpened for my taste, but otherwise very striking shot. Great colors (or lack of!). I really do like this a lot.</td>', 'Maybe slightly oversharpened for my taste, but otherwise very striking shot. Great colors (or lack of!). I really do like this a lot.', '2007-08-19 23:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012348, 569261, 43656, '<td valign="top">Simply excellent!</td>', 'Simply excellent!', '2007-08-19 23:26:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4012377, 571678, 61654, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is really beautiful. Looks like alexsaberi in Richmond Park again.    Just gorgeous.  (I know after reading the scores thread that it''s not Alex, but whoever this is did a very fine job indeed.)</td>', 'Wow. This is really beautiful. Looks like alexsaberi in Richmond Park again.    Just gorgeous.  (I know after reading the scores thread that it''s not Alex, but whoever this is did a very fine job indeed.)', '2007-08-19 23:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012394, 569421, 43656, '<td valign="top">Nice vantage, but more DOF would have lead the eye down the road better.</td>', 'Nice vantage, but more DOF would have lead the eye down the road better.', '2007-08-19 23:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012396, 571378, 61651, '<td valign="top">Appealing shot - the composition and processing.</td>', 'Appealing shot - the composition and processing.', '2007-08-19 23:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012404, 571988, 61651, '<td valign="top">Could''ve been a typical starry night shot, but your composition takes this to another level - I like the offset tree, angled horizon and infusion of red brush.</td>', 'Could''ve been a typical starry night shot, but your composition takes this to another level - I like the offset tree, angled horizon and infusion of red brush.', '2007-08-19 23:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012408, 570993, 61651, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous patchwork - IR works well here.  I really like the composition and how   effectively you get across the "far away" aspect.</td>', 'Gorgeous patchwork - IR works well here.  I really like the composition and how   effectively you get across the "far away" aspect.', '2007-08-19 23:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012416, 568343, 61651, '<td valign="top">You must have been one happy photographer to be present for that sunrise. :)  Really nice - glad you kept the "blown" part at the top - gets across the magnificence of the moment much more effectively than if you tried to crop it out or fix it.</td>', 'You must have been one happy photographer to be present for that sunrise. :)  Really nice - glad you kept the "blown" part at the top - gets across the magnificence of the moment much more effectively than if you tried to crop it out or fix it.', '2007-08-19 23:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012418, 569248, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very serene shot.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Very serene shot.  Beautiful.', '2007-08-19 23:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012423, 571908, 61651, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge - like how your framing sets up, in effect, 4 mini rural landscapes for us to look at.  Started this at a 9, bumping to a 10.</td>', 'Great take on the challenge - like how your framing sets up, in effect, 4 mini rural landscapes for us to look at.  Started this at a 9, bumping to a 10.', '2007-08-19 23:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012427, 571380, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very cool colors.  :)  You''ve taken the cliche hay bales shot and made something quite new and tasty of it.</td>', 'Very cool colors.  :)  You''ve taken the cliche hay bales shot and made something quite new and tasty of it.', '2007-08-19 23:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012428, 570104, 43656, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, but straw is too saturated for my taste, and the sky color is off.<br/>Split horizons usually aren''t good, cropping off the top third of the sky would make the composition more interesting.</td>', 'Nice scene, but straw is too saturated for my taste, and the sky color is off.Split horizons usually aren''t good, cropping off the top third of the sky would make the composition more interesting.', '2007-08-19 23:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012434, 571843, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice simple, even frank, composition - I''d go so far as to call this image "plain-spoken".  I''m impressed.</td>', 'Nice simple, even frank, composition - I''d go so far as to call this image "plain-spoken".  I''m impressed.', '2007-08-19 23:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012440, 571678, 61651, '<td valign="top">Tremendous. :)</td>', 'Tremendous. :)', '2007-08-19 23:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012441, 572003, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very cool process and framing - one of my 10s.</td>', 'Very cool process and framing - one of my 10s.', '2007-08-19 23:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012449, 571864, 43656, '<td valign="top">An idea here would be to crop with mostly sky and just skimming the horizon to catch its profile..... and also leaving out the radio tower.</td>', 'An idea here would be to crop with mostly sky and just skimming the horizon to catch its profile..... and also leaving out the radio tower.', '2007-08-19 23:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012555, 572005, 67961, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  i love the detail in the hill and the center composition works for me.</td>', 'Great shot.  i love the detail in the hill and the center composition works for me.', '2007-08-20 00:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012590, 569261, 82814, '<td valign="top">Spectacular capture, the lighting is heavenly, the moment is candid, colour tones are rich and not overdone.  Love this image.</td>', 'Spectacular capture, the lighting is heavenly, the moment is candid, colour tones are rich and not overdone.  Love this image.', '2007-08-20 00:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012600, 571731, 82814, '<td valign="top">Humourous capture, great colour tones, really well done - love it!</td>', 'Humourous capture, great colour tones, really well done - love it!', '2007-08-20 01:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012608, 571678, 82814, '<td valign="top">Wow, great moment to witness let alone capture so brilliantly.  Excellent image.</td>', 'Wow, great moment to witness let alone capture so brilliantly.  Excellent image.', '2007-08-20 01:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012665, 571989, 82814, '<td valign="top">Impressive colour tones, good composition and pleasing setting.  I''m inspired to repaint my kitchen in these tones now that I see how incredible they are together.</td>', 'Impressive colour tones, good composition and pleasing setting.  I''m inspired to repaint my kitchen in these tones now that I see how incredible they are together.', '2007-08-20 01:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012681, 569111, 82814, '<td valign="top">Has a terrific travel journalism feel...next stop National Geographic?</td>', 'Has a terrific travel journalism feel...next stop National Geographic?', '2007-08-20 01:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012704, 571757, 82814, '<td valign="top">Grand morning indeed.  Wonderful, surreal capture.  I''d questions the depth of tones except I''ve been there and seen them with my own eyes.  Beautiful image.</td>', 'Grand morning indeed.  Wonderful, surreal capture.  I''d questions the depth of tones except I''ve been there and seen them with my own eyes.  Beautiful image.', '2007-08-20 01:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012736, 568278, 82814, '<td valign="top">My, my, my ...I''m so jelous that I was not there to capture this myself, and that I likely would not have captured this as nicely as you have.  I''d be speachless if I didn''t have so many nice things to say about this image.  This is a 10 out of 10 for me.</td>', 'My, my, my ...I''m so jelous that I was not there to capture this myself, and that I likely would not have captured this as nicely as you have.  I''d be speachless if I didn''t have so many nice things to say about this image.  This is a 10 out of 10 for me.', '2007-08-20 01:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012802, 571114, 82814, '<td valign="top">Superb colour, texture and timing.  Well done.</td>', 'Superb colour, texture and timing.  Well done.', '2007-08-20 01:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012817, 571686, 82814, '<td valign="top">Love the sepia treatment on this capture.</td>', 'Love the sepia treatment on this capture.', '2007-08-20 01:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012838, 571846, 82814, '<td valign="top">Thought provoking.  This capture poses many questions in my mind...where is he going?, what is going to shoot at?, what is the purpose of the structure in the background?</td>', 'Thought provoking.  This capture poses many questions in my mind...where is he going?, what is going to shoot at?, what is the purpose of the structure in the background?', '2007-08-20 01:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012854, 571258, 82814, '<td valign="top">Excellent clarity and reflection.  Might have preferred this image in landscape format, but superb capture just the same.</td>', 'Excellent clarity and reflection.  Might have preferred this image in landscape format, but superb capture just the same.', '2007-08-20 01:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4012919, 570993, 82814, '<td valign="top">One of the most interesting applications of colour and sepia I''ve seen in quite a while.  Very cool.</td>', 'One of the most interesting applications of colour and sepia I''ve seen in quite a while.  Very cool.', '2007-08-20 01:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
