(4014531, 571882, 74015, '<td valign="top">The subject''s lines are interesting, I think they should have been your main subject in the frame, with a lot less sky.</td>', 'The subject''s lines are interesting, I think they should have been your main subject in the frame, with a lot less sky.', '2007-08-20 13:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4014535, 570017, 74015, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition.  I like how the hay field creates a zig zag line with the stone wall and the nice contrast of the yellow and greens.</td>', 'Very interesting composition.  I like how the hay field creates a zig zag line with the stone wall and the nice contrast of the yellow and greens.', '2007-08-20 13:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4014544, 571846, 67258, '<td valign="top">...who lived on the outside of town?  Probably my favourite of the challenge - the sparseness of the landscape is spot on for your imagery, with perfect placement of your lone figure.  The viewer is encouraged to invent their own narrative around the picture - the sort of photo that can cope with many repeated visits.</td>', '...who lived on the outside of town?  Probably my favourite of the challenge - the sparseness of the landscape is spot on for your imagery, with perfect placement of your lone figure.  The viewer is encouraged to invent their own narrative around the picture - the sort of photo that can cope with many repeated visits.', '2007-08-20 13:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4014548, 571442, 74015, '<td valign="top">Too underexposed.  We can,t even see most of the subject that in the shadows.  Maybe a bit of flash would have helped.</td>', 'Too underexposed.  We can,t even see most of the subject that in the shadows.  Maybe a bit of flash would have helped.', '2007-08-20 13:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4014551, 568167, 74015, '<td valign="top">Underexposed and too busy for me.  you should have singled out one flower instead of the whole bunch to give a point to the image.</td>', 'Underexposed and too busy for me.  you should have singled out one flower instead of the whole bunch to give a point to the image.', '2007-08-20 13:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4014560, 571232, 74015, '<td valign="top">Be aware of the purple fringing your lens gives you at (I suppose) its minimum focal length.  The rays of light are really nice though.</td>', 'Be aware of the purple fringing your lens gives you at (I suppose) its minimum focal length.  The rays of light are really nice though.', '2007-08-20 13:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4014566, 571830, 74015, '<td valign="top">over processed and too heavy on the saturation IMO.</td>', 'over processed and too heavy on the saturation IMO.', '2007-08-20 13:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4014577, 570792, 74015, '<td valign="top">I am guessing that the light levels were just too low for you to handhold your camera without sacrificing sharpness.</td>', 'I am guessing that the light levels were just too low for you to handhold your camera without sacrificing sharpness.', '2007-08-20 13:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4014595, 571954, 74015, '<td valign="top">You probably had to underexpose so as not to over blow the highlights in the clouds but the result is that you end up with grayish fields where we expect gold.  Shots like this are exactly why there are graduated ND filters and/or neutral gray, gradient layers in Photoshop.  otherwise, your composition is good, with leading lines and good use of the rule of thirds.  Keep it up!</td>', 'You probably had to underexpose so as not to over blow the highlights in the clouds but the result is that you end up with grayish fields where we expect gold.  Shots like this are exactly why there are graduated ND filters and/or neutral gray, gradient layers in Photoshop.  otherwise, your composition is good, with leading lines and good use of the rule of thirds.  Keep it up!', '2007-08-20 13:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4014637, 570498, 74015, '<td valign="top">I am sure it is a very nice place but there is no point to this image, it does not tell any story.</td>', 'I am sure it is a very nice place but there is no point to this image, it does not tell any story.', '2007-08-20 14:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4014642, 571678, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very impressive -- caught at a great time of day, too, by the looks of things.</td>', 'Very impressive -- caught at a great time of day, too, by the looks of things.', '2007-08-20 14:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4014653, 570574, 31917, '<td valign="top">there is such a great opportunity for a better shot here.  if you return to this spot, try a vertical shot and closer to the ground and the trees getting a better perspective of the road coming into the foreground and just barely getting the vacancy sign in on the left side.  even just cropping out to the first fence post on the left and on the other side of the right gate fence helps alot.</td>', 'there is such a great opportunity for a better shot here.  if you return to this spot, try a vertical shot and closer to the ground and the trees getting a better perspective of the road coming into the foreground and just barely getting the vacancy sign in on the left side.  even just cropping out to the first fence post on the left and on the other side of the right gate fence helps alot.', '2007-08-20 14:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4014659, 570018, 31917, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the perspective of the buildings into the distance with a nice balance of negative space.</td>', 'I like the composition and the perspective of the buildings into the distance with a nice balance of negative space.', '2007-08-20 14:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4014662, 569486, 31917, '<td valign="top">a well balanced compostion.</td>', 'a well balanced compostion.', '2007-08-20 14:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
