(4015282, 571477, 70181, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a beautiful place to have a home.  Colors, sky, composition, clarity, I love it all.</td>', 'Wow, what a beautiful place to have a home.  Colors, sky, composition, clarity, I love it all.', '2007-08-20 18:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
