(4015292, 570451, 70181, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot.  Very different from anything else in the challenge.  I like the setup.  Well done.</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot.  Very different from anything else in the challenge.  I like the setup.  Well done.', '2007-08-20 18:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
