(4016052, 569798, 77724, '<td valign="top">First glance I see trees &amp; clouds and I''m thinking ok nice colors, nice sharpness good exposure but not very interesting.  Then I read the title "DENALI."  Hey, isn''t that a mountain? D''OH! There''s a mountain back there.  Wow.  Excellent.</td>', 'First glance I see trees & clouds and I''m thinking ok nice colors, nice sharpness good exposure but not very interesting.  Then I read the title "DENALI."  Hey, isn''t that a mountain? D''OH! There''s a mountain back there.  Wow.  Excellent.', '2007-08-20 23:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4016100, 570818, 66494, '<td valign="top">The black wedge at the right side is distracting, however, this is a magnificent shot.</td>', 'The black wedge at the right side is distracting, however, this is a magnificent shot.', '2007-08-20 23:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
