(4018165, 571116, 18197, '<td valign="top">One of my pet peeves is a slanted photo. Straighten this and I''d give it an extra point. Otherwise a good workmanlike photo.</td>', 'One of my pet peeves is a slanted photo. Straighten this and I''d give it an extra point. Otherwise a good workmanlike photo.', '2007-08-21 19:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
