(4019349, 569261, 63398, '<td valign="top">Upon reading the story, I''m even more glad I came back and bumped this. An awesome, once-in-a-lifetime shot and I''m proud to be on the front page with it! My heartiest congratulations!</td>', 'Upon reading the story, I''m even more glad I came back and bumped this. An awesome, once-in-a-lifetime shot and I''m proud to be on the front page with it! My heartiest congratulations!', '2007-08-22 01:49:15.000000', NULL, 0),
