(4019375, 571262, 66384, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, I like this. Landscape is really your forte! I very surprised this didn''t score higher -- the mood is strong, and the subject is interesting and well composed. Maybe not sharp enough and bright enough for DPC.</td>', 'Ooooh, I like this. Landscape is really your forte! I very surprised this didn''t score higher -- the mood is strong, and the subject is interesting and well composed. Maybe not sharp enough and bright enough for DPC.', '2007-08-22 01:56:42.000000', NULL, 0),
