(4019398, 568343, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''d say it did OK.  :-)  Maybe one too many USMs for my taste, but I like things softer than most folks do - the softness adds to the "sunrise" bit you were going for.  I suspect you can do a lot more with it under advanced or non-DPC editing rules if you wish, and I also suspect it''ll make a stunning and profitable print.</td>', 'I''d say it did OK.  :-)  Maybe one too many USMs for my taste, but I like things softer than most folks do - the softness adds to the "sunrise" bit you were going for.  I suspect you can do a lot more with it under advanced or non-DPC editing rules if you wish, and I also suspect it''ll make a stunning and profitable print.', '2007-08-22 02:03:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4019399, 570358, 66384, '<td valign="top">Amazing light and mood. I like this so much. Congratulations on a great picture and a top 10 finish.</td>', 'Amazing light and mood. I like this so much. Congratulations on a great picture and a top 10 finish.', '2007-08-22 02:04:10.000000', NULL, 0),
