(4019749, 572008, 31637, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m on Clint Eastwoods movie set. Low lighting is not distributed well, the light is not ambient enough, but a lovely scene and nicely composed.<br/> <br/>Back for 2nd comment, I was looking at your specs and you should try this again with a slower shutter speed, say...something around 5 seconds or so. I only boost the ISO if I''m indoors. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-29 01:31:58.</i></td>', 'I feel like I''m on Clint Eastwoods movie set. Low lighting is not distributed well, the light is not ambient enough, but a lovely scene and nicely composed. Back for 2nd comment, I was looking at your specs and you should try this again with a slower shutter speed, say...something around 5 seconds or so. I only boost the ISO if I''m indoors. :)', '2007-08-22 04:39:10.000000', '2007-08-29 02:31:58.000000', 0),
