(4019765, 571380, 49109, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by AlexSaberi:</b></div><hr/><i> horrid colours. Too unreal! <br/> <br/>Rural areas (also referred to as "the country", countryside) are sparsely settled places away from the influence of large cities </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the lesson, Alex. I have been there, and it was a "sparsely settled place away from the influence of large cities". It wasn''t taken in a park or a zoo. And the only unreal color here is the orange of the sky, the rest was untouched. You might want to got to the countryside yourself some time and see how it looks outside of London.</td>', 'Originally posted by AlexSaberi: horrid colours. Too unreal!  Rural areas (also referred to as "the country", countryside) are sparsely settled places away from the influence of large cities   Thanks for the lesson, Alex. I have been there, and it was a "sparsely settled place away from the influence of large cities". It wasn''t taken in a park or a zoo. And the only unreal color here is the orange of the sky, the rest was untouched. You might want to got to the countryside yourself some time and see how it looks outside of London.', '2007-08-22 04:54:38.000000', NULL, 0),
