(4020126, 569876, 51793, '<td valign="top">You know it''s amazing that you ask for a 1 and you get all this:<br/>27 3''s, 17 3''s and 4''s, 13 5''s, 3 6''s, 2 7''s an 8 2 9''s and 3 10''s. Even though you went for what you got it still doesn''t mean that people should give you a sympathy vote or 85 of them for that matter. This is a good example of why some people shouldn''t be able to vote on other pictures. On the other hand, you got what you wanted and that''s cool.<br/></td>', 'You know it''s amazing that you ask for a 1 and you get all this:27 3''s, 17 3''s and 4''s, 13 5''s, 3 6''s, 2 7''s an 8 2 9''s and 3 10''s. Even though you went for what you got it still doesn''t mean that people should give you a sympathy vote or 85 of them for that matter. This is a good example of why some people shouldn''t be able to vote on other pictures. On the other hand, you got what you wanted and that''s cool.', '2007-08-22 08:58:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4020130, 569879, 74078, '<td valign="top">Another nice one Judi.<br/> <br/>How in the hell you received votes of 2 or three for this is beyond me. I would love to see those that vote that way explain the reasons and show what they voted (ie the score they gave). No idea what they could be thinking to do this.<br/> <br/>On your shot though. Love the effect created by the fish eye lens. Great lines, (cow poo included) throughout the shot. I love the contrast of the harsh red earth with the bright blue sky. I agree with Sherpert, deserved more.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Another nice one Judi. How in the hell you received votes of 2 or three for this is beyond me. I would love to see those that vote that way explain the reasons and show what they voted (ie the score they gave). No idea what they could be thinking to do this. On your shot though. Love the effect created by the fish eye lens. Great lines, (cow poo included) throughout the shot. I love the contrast of the harsh red earth with the bright blue sky. I agree with Sherpert, deserved more. ', '2007-08-22 09:00:39.000000', NULL, 0),
