(4023507, 569261, 54228, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, having seen it I would certainly have voted a 9 or a 10... I don''t quite see the urban <i>landscape</i> but that''s not really what counts. A beatiful photo in every respect and a well worthy second place! Well done!</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, having seen it I would certainly have voted a 9 or a 10... I don''t quite see the urban landscape but that''s not really what counts. A beatiful photo in every respect and a well worthy second place! Well done!', '2007-08-23 08:40:59.000000', NULL, 0),
