(4029313, 569261, 56744, '<td valign="top">The light and the splashes puts this image in the category of the divine shots. Technically you did a great job with the foreground and background light while the composition was already there just waiting for you to shoot your camera. The natural triangular frame does a great job pushing our attention to the main scene and subtracting any distracting element that could weak the image. The word that I usually use to describe pictures like this, is "perfect". Congrats for this stunning image.</td>', 'The light and the splashes puts this image in the category of the divine shots. Technically you did a great job with the foreground and background light while the composition was already there just waiting for you to shoot your camera. The natural triangular frame does a great job pushing our attention to the main scene and subtracting any distracting element that could weak the image. The word that I usually use to describe pictures like this, is "perfect". Congrats for this stunning image.', '2007-08-26 02:19:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4030053, 571464, 77369, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Blackbox:</b></div><hr/><i> Hey Kellie! Back in the saddle again huh? Way to go! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you buddy!  Ya, I figured what the heck, I was quite honored to get into the 20''s...I was sure it''s be more like the 100''s, lol!</td>', 'Originally posted by Blackbox: Hey Kellie! Back in the saddle again huh? Way to go!   Thank you buddy!  Ya, I figured what the heck, I was quite honored to get into the 20''s...I was sure it''s be more like the 100''s, lol!', '2007-08-26 15:00:44.000000', NULL, 0),
