(4057992, 570390, 61651, '<td valign="top">I really would have preferred it if the cows had raised their heads instead of lowered their heads. :P Just kidding.  I think this is a very true-to-life depiction of a gorgeous landscape - sky is absolutely an important part of what makes this environment sing.</td>', 'I really would have preferred it if the cows had raised their heads instead of lowered their heads. :P Just kidding.  I think this is a very true-to-life depiction of a gorgeous landscape - sky is absolutely an important part of what makes this environment sing.', '2007-09-04 19:42:53.000000', NULL, 0),
