(4058364, 569780, 61651, '<td valign="top">Well, heck, you did better than you predicted!  This has a nice warm feel overall, and I especially like how you got the low sun lighting up the barn wall.</td>', 'Well, heck, you did better than you predicted!  This has a nice warm feel overall, and I especially like how you got the low sun lighting up the barn wall.', '2007-09-04 22:05:48.000000', NULL, 0),
