(4793660, 571846, 34192, '<td valign="top">I was rummaging around, seeing what was accepted for the last rural challenge before I go and try to get something last minute and this popped up. Wow!  As usual, and I was not surprised to see your name attached.  And then I was brought immediately to <i>Christina''s World</i>, which is one of my favorite paintings of all time.  And this so reminds me of that, the push and pull between melancholy and hope, that I had to comment.  You see, looking back on my own self portraits (most are not here) I am trying to recreate <i>Christina''s World</i>.  And here you have done that, only it is your world.  So cool.  And thrown in is a little bit of <i>Turkey Pond</i>, if only because it is a man with a purpose... I love everything about this you know.  Excellent image.</td>', 'I was rummaging around, seeing what was accepted for the last rural challenge before I go and try to get something last minute and this popped up. Wow!  As usual, and I was not surprised to see your name attached.  And then I was brought immediately to Christina''s World, which is one of my favorite paintings of all time.  And this so reminds me of that, the push and pull between melancholy and hope, that I had to comment.  You see, looking back on my own self portraits (most are not here) I am trying to recreate Christina''s World.  And here you have done that, only it is your world.  So cool.  And thrown in is a little bit of Turkey Pond, if only because it is a man with a purpose... I love everything about this you know.  Excellent image.', '2008-07-01 10:21:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916596, 569248, 49804, '<td valign="top">Great shot, very fitting for rural, definitely something that you think of when you think rural. Great silhouettes, not to mention the great colors and composition, nicely done, added to faves.</td>', 'Great shot, very fitting for rural, definitely something that you think of when you think rural. Great silhouettes, not to mention the great colors and composition, nicely done, added to faves.', '2008-08-27 22:15:59.000000', NULL, 0),
